# Second boot: what the first one wrote is here, synced or not.
! panicked
! storage failed
< zosh$ 
> cat notes.txt\r
< first line
< second line
< zosh$ 
> cat work/inner.txt\r
< kept
< zosh$ 
> cat work/new.txt\r
< moved
< zosh$ 
> cat unsynced.txt\r
< the shell never asked
< zosh$ 
> cat gone.txt\r
< zosh: cat: NotFound
< zosh$ 
> poweroff\r
